                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "was a pretty decent game. I liked the simple top-down shooting and the fact that you can upgrade your weapons and abilities as you progress. There’s also a good amount of zombies to shoot, so the action can get pretty chaotic.\r\n\r\nIt does start to feel a bit repetitive after a while, and the story wasn't anything special for me. Still, I had a decent time playing it and enjoyed the gameplay for what it was.\r\n\r\nNot an amazing game, but definitely not a bad one either. A decent zombie shooter if you just want something simple to play.",
